        "func": "// Extrage valoarea din payload-ul Ignition\nvar value = parseFloat(msg.payload);\n\n// Format corect pentru OPC UA Client Write\nmsg.payload = [\n    {\n        nodeId: \"ns=4;i=58\",\n        value: {\n            value: {\n                dataType: 10,  // Float\n                value: value\n            }\n        }\n    }\n];\n\nmsg.topic = \"writeNodesToSession\";\n\nreturn msg;",
